  "notes": "13 CSS custom properties, e.g. --sand-0, --sand-1, --sand-2, --sand-3.\n\nUse: npm i open-props, then @import \"open-props/sand\" (or copy the variables).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/argyleink/open-props/blob/main/src/props.sand.css",
  "code": "<style>\n:where(html) {\n  --sand-0: #f8fafb;\n  --sand-1: #e6e4dc;\n  --sand-2: #d5cfbd;\n  --sand-3: #c2b9a0;\n  --sand-4: #aea58c;\n  --sand-5: #9a9178;\n  --sand-6: #867c65;\n  --sand-7: #736a53;\n  --sand-8: #5f5746;\n  --sand-9: #4b4639;\n  --sand-10: #38352d;\n  --sand-11: #252521;\n  --sand-12: #121210;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Open Props sand</strong>\n<p>sand</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafb\" title=\"--sand-0: #f8fafb\"><span>0</span></div><div style=\"background:#e6e4dc\" title=\"--sand-1: #e6e4dc\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#d5cfbd\" title=\"--sand-2: #d5cfbd\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#c2b9a0\" title=\"--sand-3: #c2b9a0\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#aea58c\" title=\"--sand-4: #aea58c\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#9a9178\" title=\"--sand-5: #9a9178\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#867c65\" title=\"--sand-6: #867c65\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#736a53\" title=\"--sand-7: #736a53\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#5f5746\" title=\"--sand-8: #5f5746\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#4b4639\" title=\"--sand-9: #4b4639\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#38352d\" title=\"--sand-10: #38352d\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#252521\" title=\"--sand-11: #252521\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#121210\" title=\"--sand-12: #121210\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
